<title>USA: IntelliQuest reports expected Q3 results.</title>
<headline>IntelliQuest reports expected Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>IntelliQuest Information Group Inc Tuesday announced its preliminary third quarter results.</p>
<p>						Quarter Ended September 30</p>
<p>						     1995	    1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>   Renewable subscription-based products $4,068	  $4,640</p>
<p>   Renewable proprietary products	   2,137	   3,237</p>
<p>   Proprietary project research		 647	   1,123</p>
<p>    Total revenues				6,852	   9,036</p>
<p>Operating income				    644	   1,302</p>
<p>Net income					    348	   1,060</p>
<p>Pro forma and actual information:</p>
<p>   Net income per share		     $   .06	 $   .14</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>and common equivalent shares</p>
<p>    outstanding				   5,540	   7,228</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk</p>
